    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The ReProver model achieves state-of-the-art results on the LeanDojo Benchmark, outperforming non-retrieval baselines and GPT-4. The model is able to prove 51.2% of the theorems in the benchmark, compared to 47.6% for the non-retrieval baseline and 29.0% for GPT-4.",
